,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_152","text":"They volunteered because they wanted to serve Syuen. They wanted to be her instrument.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_06_e_153","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_153","text":"You'll have to ask them for the details.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_06_e_154","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_154","text":"What about you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_06_e_155","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_155","text":"I don't know. How can I know what the human Maxwell thought?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_06_e_156","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_156","text":"That part of me is dead. I'm a Nikke now, aren't I?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_06_e_157","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_157","text":"... That's right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_06_e_158","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_06_e_158","text":"Whether our being heroic was something we decided ourselves,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":n